{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2000_situation", "source_sha256": "f0b503aed1ead9c5929f835d36b041ede9100c8d49ed11edacedcdc6b8a0c1ea", "ja": "水着グラビアのお仕事　撮影前", "zh": "泳装写真工作　拍摄前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2001_009rit", "source_sha256": "a07cd9385d1efddf7306e8aed7f6d0a74709d87bd97e0c10fccab1a13baad813", "ja": "そろそろ準備の時間ですね。それじゃプロデューサー、\n撮影用の水着に着替えてきます！　ふふっ♪", "zh": "差不多是该准备的时间了。那么制作人，\n我去换拍摄用的泳装了！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2002_p", "source_sha256": "804af67a0c3b3f5a3e69f4ff2f8701c32cff45f461539c0c3b783c78fcee8fd7", "ja": "お、おう。珍しいな、律子が水着グラビアで\nやる気マンマンだなんて。", "zh": "好、好喔。真难得，\n律子居然会对拍泳装写真这么有干劲。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2003_009rit", "source_sha256": "e45da31303959902118e6d0a4b7bf07532777bed3406a7f5be0a893fe8693373", "ja": "そ、そんなにヘンですか……？　まぁ、確かに最初は\n気が重かったんですけどね。スタイルには自信ないし。", "zh": "有、有这么奇怪吗……？不过，我刚开始的确\n是提不起什么劲呢，因为我对身材没自信啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2004_p", "source_sha256": "e857022eb9a4e4a9c72443c1f986715ed20e6f07892615ed182f809eb32f7ab0", "ja": "うーん、そうなのか……。", "zh": "唔～是这样子啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2005_009rit", "source_sha256": "759bcf4e0265f39518b664fe40152b47c91ada0472d784a21c7024fdd48e43eb", "ja": "でも、この前莉緒さんに、くびれエクササイズを\n教えてもらったんです！　これがすごい効果で！", "zh": "不过，前阵子莉绪教了我雕塑腰部曲线的体操！\n而且还非常有效果！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2006_009rit", "source_sha256": "1863814a6315cae218cab8bca9a619a19357941cd89266afd180be4081c71cb2", "ja": "撮ってもらうなら、今しかないかなと。\nさあ、秋月律子のレアショットに、乞うご期待！", "zh": "所以我想如果要拍写真，就只能趁现在了。\n来，敬请期待秋月律子的珍贵镜头吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_009rit_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_009rit_2007_p", "source_sha256": "6a23164c3232153e7d665bf00140b199cd4f777b90c0b399dad6d8ff6d9e43f5", "ja": "そういうことなら、遠慮なく期待させてもらうよ。\n律子の魅力、たっぷり撮ってもらおう！", "zh": "既然是这样的话，那我就不客气地期待了。\n在镜头前尽情展现律子的魅力吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
